flowchart TB
  subgraph Live[Live application data]
    direction LR
    App[Astro application] --> Drizzle[Drizzle ORM]
    Drizzle --> Driver[better-sqlite3]
    Driver --> WAL[(SQLite database and WAL)]
    Sharp[Sharp pipeline] --> Uploads[(Uploads volume)]
  end

  subgraph Remote[Cloudflare R2 backups]
    direction LR
    Litestream[Litestream sidecar] -->|continuous replicas and 6-hour snapshots| DatabaseBackup[(Database history)]
    Rclone[rclone sidecar] --> CurrentImages[(Current uploads)]
    Rclone --> ArchiveImages[(Timestamped archive)]
  end

  subgraph Recovery[Restore and verification]
    direction LR
    DatabaseBackup -->|database missing at startup| RestoreDB[Litestream restore]
    RestoreDB --> RestoredDB[(Recovered SQLite)]
    DatabaseBackup -->|nightly temporary restore| Integrity[SQLite integrity check]
    Integrity --> Monitoring[Backup health check]
    CurrentImages -->|disaster-recovery script| RestoreImages[Restored uploads volume]
  end

  WAL -->|changes every 1 second| Litestream
  Uploads -->|daily read-only copy| Rclone